# Route: guide 49 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Troll (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 60 to 60, 20
# quests, 2.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Tirisfal Glades, Western Plaguelands, Swamp of Sorrows, Azshara,
# Moonglade, Burning Steppes): The Bulwark -> The Writhing Haunt -> The
# Bulwark -> Stagalbog -> Stonard -> Splinterspear Junction -> Ravencrest
# Monument -> Moonglade -> Ruins of Thaurissan.
#
# Left out: Gahrron's Withering Cauldron (5227), Continued Threat (1428): the
# route takes them here but cannot finish them (the coverage report's missed
# quests).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Vorrel's Revenge (1051), Barov Family Fortune (5341), The
# Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), Crest of
# Lordaeron (95204), Unending Torment (97288), Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the
# Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper
# (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), Oculus
# Illusions (6569), Dark Iron Legacy (3802), A Taste of Flame (4024),
# Precarious Predicament (4121), The Heart of the Mountain (4123), Egg
# Freezing (4734), Egg Collection (4735).

